    Note over User,Provider: New User Flow

    User->>Frontend: Click sign in
    Frontend->>Backend: Redirect to OAuth
    Backend->>Provider: Request verification
    Provider->>Backend: Return identity
    Backend->>Backend: User not found
    Backend->>Frontend: Complete signup
    Frontend->>User: Show form
    User->>Frontend: Enter details
    Frontend->>Backend: Submit info
    Backend->>Backend: Create user
    Backend->>Backend: Issue token
    Backend->>Frontend: Send token
    Frontend->>User: Show dashboard
